    "pocketstation::codec::encoder::OpusApplication::Voip: Optimised for voice (VOIP). Default for PocketStation broadcast.",
    "pocketstation::codec::encoder::OpusApplication::LowDelay: Optimised for low algorithmic delay. Use for real-time voice agents.",
    "pocketstation::codec::encoder::OpusApplication::Audio: Optimised for audio quality (music/broadcast).",
    "pocketstation::codec::encoder::OpusConfig: Explicit configuration for an Opus encoder instance.",
    "OpusConfig::sample_rate: Sample rate. Opus only supports 48 kHz internally.",
    "OpusConfig::channels: Selects the mono or stereo channel layout accepted by the encoder.",
    "OpusConfig::frame_duration: Frame duration. Default: 20 ms (AUDIO-012).",
    "OpusConfig::application: Selects the Opus application mode used when the encoder is created.",
    "OpusConfig::bitrate_kbps: Target bitrate in kbps. None = Opus auto (variable bitrate).",
